{"id":"A1-L075","title":"Subject + verb + indirect/direct object: form","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U05","focus":"Subject + verb + indirect/direct object — forma","targets":{"grammar":"Subject + verb + indirect/direct object — forma","pron":"think/this","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["card","warehouse","delivery truck","assembly line","safety helmet","uniform","name tag","union","strike","unemployed","freelance","remote","startup","company"],"field":"Trabalho","genre":"Resenha / review","skill":"Fala","words_min":14},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 75 · Subject + verb + indirect/direct object: form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Subject + verb + indirect/direct object — forma.","**Pronúncia:** think/this.","**8 palavras novas** (trabalho).","**Texto do dia:** resenha / review."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo montar frases com dois objetos (give someone something)."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["card","cartão"],["warehouse","warehouse"],["delivery truck","delivery truck"],["assembly line","assembly line"],["safety helmet","safety helmet"],["uniform","uniform"],["name tag","name tag"],["union","union"],["strike","strike"],["unemployed","unemployed"],["freelance","freelance"],["remote","remote"],["startup","startup"],["company","company"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A review","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Review: Office Gift Cards ★★★★☆","paras":["This service **sends** your team a card every birthday. The boss **gives** them a small gift, and the clerk **brings** coffee.","I **told** (tell) the manager: “**Send me** the list.” He **showed me** the price. Fair!"],"kicker":"SERVICE REVIEW","by":"Mia","gloss":[["card","cartão"],["gift","presente"],["list","lista"],["price","preço"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The service sends a card.","ans":"T","why":"“sends your team a card.”"},{"q":"The clerk gives a gift.","ans":"F","why":"O chefe dá."},{"q":"The manager showed the price.","ans":"T","why":"“showed me the price.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“card” (aqui) means…","opts":["cartão","carta de baralho","cardápio"],"ans":0,"why":"card."},{"q":"“list” means…","opts":["lista","lição","linha"],"ans":0,"why":"list."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"S + V + IO + DO","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["S","V","IO","DO"],"rows":[["The boss","**gives**","them","a gift"],["She","**sends**","me","a card"],["He","**shows**","us","the price"]],"cap":"S + V + IO + DO"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Duas formas: **give someone something** ou **give something to someone**: *gives a gift to them*."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Com pronome: *Send **me** the list* (não *Send the list me*)."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She sends ___ a card. (I)","a":"me","why":"pronome objeto."},{"s":"He shows ___ the price. (we)","a":"us","why":"pronome objeto."},{"s":"The boss gives a gift ___ them. (to)","a":"to","why":"give X to Y."},{"s":"Send ___ the list. (I)","a":"me","why":"pronome objeto."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["card","cartão"],["gift","presente"],["list","lista"],["price","preço"],["manager","gerente"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["you","are","Here"],"ans":"Here you are","pt":"Aqui está."},{"words":["me","the","card","Show"],"ans":"Show me the card","pt":"Mostre-me o cartão."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"card","pos":"word","pt":"cartão","ex":"A birthday card.","expt":"Um cartão de aniversário."},{"w":"warehouse","pos":"word","pt":"warehouse","ex":"armazém","expt":"A big warehouse."},{"w":"delivery truck","pos":"word","pt":"delivery truck","ex":"caminhão de entrega","expt":"A delivery truck."},{"w":"assembly line","pos":"word","pt":"assembly line","ex":"linha de montagem","expt":"An assembly line."},{"w":"safety helmet","pos":"word","pt":"safety helmet","ex":"capacete de segurança","expt":"Wear a safety helmet."},{"w":"uniform","pos":"word","pt":"uniform","ex":"uniforme","expt":"A clean uniform."},{"w":"name tag","pos":"word","pt":"name tag","ex":"crachá","expt":"Wear a name tag."},{"w":"union","pos":"word","pt":"union","ex":"sindicato","expt":"Join the union."},{"w":"strike","pos":"word","pt":"strike","ex":"greve","expt":"A long strike."},{"w":"unemployed","pos":"word","pt":"unemployed","ex":"desempregado","expt":"An unemployed worker."},{"w":"freelance","pos":"word","pt":"freelance","ex":"autônomo","expt":"A freelance designer."},{"w":"remote","pos":"word","pt":"remote","ex":"remoto","expt":"Remote work."},{"w":"startup","pos":"word","pt":"startup","ex":"startup","expt":"A small startup."},{"w":"company","pos":"word","pt":"company","ex":"empresa","expt":"A big company."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Can you send me the list?** — Pode me enviar a lista?","**Sure. I’ll send you the price, too.** — Claro. Envio o preço também.","**Show me the card.** — Mostre-me o cartão.","**Let’s get started.** — Vamos começar.","**Let’s call it a day.** — Vamos encerrar por hoje.","**Don’t worry about it.** — Não se preocupe."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"send","pt":"enviar","forms":[["I / you / we / they send","I send a letter."],["he / she / it sends","She sends a text."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the desk","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the desk","lines":[["Ana","Can you send me the list?","Pode me enviar a lista?"],["Leo","Sure. I’ll send you the price, too.","Claro. Envio o preço também."],["Ana","Show me the card.","Mostre-me o cartão."],["Leo","Here you are.","Aqui está."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: think/this","items":[{"label":"think/this","note":"/θ/ sem voz (think) × /ð/ com voz (this): língua entre os dentes.","words":["think","this","three","that","thank","they"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Use give + person + thing.","pt":"Diga.","model":"Give me the key."},{"q":"Ask someone to send you something.","pt":"Peça.","model":"Can you send me the list?"},{"q":"Say what you show someone.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I show him the price."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with two objects.","model":"The boss gives us a gift. She sends me a card. He shows us the price. I bring her coffee. Send me the list.","checklist":["Usei **IO + DO**","Usei **me/us/her**","Usei **to**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “card” mean?","opts":["presente","preço","cartão"],"ans":2,"why":"**card** = cartão."},{"q":"What does “gift” mean?","opts":["presente","lista","gerente"],"ans":0,"why":"**gift** = presente."},{"q":"What does “list” mean?","opts":["preço","lista","serviço"],"ans":1,"why":"**list** = lista."},{"q":"What does “price” mean?","opts":["gerente","equipe","preço"],"ans":2,"why":"**price** = preço."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}